abstract: >
  FeuPy Data is the companion scientific data repository for FeuPy,
  a Python package for high-energy and very-high-energy gamma-ray
  astrophysics.

  The repository provides versioned gamma-ray source catalogs,
  data products associated with dedicated scientific publications,
  instrument response functions, interstellar radiation field
  models and related metadata, documentation, and supporting files
  used in FeuPy analyses.

  FeuPy Data is maintained separately from the FeuPy source code
  to preserve reproducibility and allow software and dataset
  versions to evolve independently.

  The repository provides access to or integration with external
  scientific datasets, including instrument response functions
  from the Cherenkov Telescope Array Observatory and Galactic
  interstellar radiation field models.

  Third-party scientific datasets retain their original licenses,
  attribution requirements, and redistribution conditions.
  Some external scientific data files must be obtained separately
  from their original distributions.

